OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CStaff gagging clauses lifted ahead of  
OL,5,Cprobe into culture at data watchdog    
OL,6,GNon-disclosure agreements (NDAs)       
OL,7,Gsigned by staff at the UK's            
OL,8,Ginformation watchdog will be lifted to 
OL,9,Gallow them to speak out about its      
OL,10,Gculture, the government has confirmed. 
OL,12,FMinisters are expected to publish the  
OL,13,Fdetails of how an independent review   
OL,14,Fof the working environment at the      
OL,15,FInformation Commission will be carried 
OL,16,Fout next week.                         
OL,18,FIt follows the departure of the        
OL,19,Fwatchdog's boss five months ago amid   
OL,20,Fallegations of sexually inappropriate  
OL,21,Fbehaviour.                             
